Body:
I had to use the agent -> build -> permission nested approach.  Absolutely would not work otherwise.
```

{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "theme": "tokyonight",
  "agent": {
    "build": {
      "permission": {
        "grep": "allow",
        "glob": "allow",
        "read": "allow",
        "bash": {
          "*": "ask",
          "ls *": "allow",
          "find *": "allow",
          "head *": "allow",
          "pwd": "allow"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

```

This format would NOT work:
```

{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
    "permission": {
      "*": "allow",
      "bash": {
        "rm *": "ask"
      }
    }
}
```
I wonder if you could get away with "agent": {"permission":...} to set permissions for all agents.
